= Bolesław Drobner

Drobner belongs to the cast of the continuation (from January 1928 in chapter 2). He represents Lewica PPS and focuses on political negotiation with the KPP.

His actions are recorded for chapter 2 (Z — 0.29, M17); in this chapter he cannot be appointed.

